# The doer's harness.
#
# It may inspect and edit files. It has no `bash`: the station that makes a
# change must not be the one that produces the evidence about it, or there is
# nothing left to check the change against.
#
# `run_tests` is not a way around that. It takes no arguments and runs exactly
# one script — the same test-runner station the orchestrator runs. The doer can
# ask for that one test run and nothing else; there is no command for it to
# widen, because there is no command argument at all.
TOOLS="read,edit,write,grep,find,ls,run_tests"
MODEL="anthropic/claude-opus-4-7"
EXTENSION="extensions/run-tests-tool.ts"
